# Azure Cluster Storage

When deploying on Azure clusters, always use **ReadWriteOnce (RWO)** PVCs, never ReadWriteMany (RWX). Azure managed disks do not support RWX access mode.

This applies to:
- Golden RHCOS PVCs/DataVolumes
- VM root disk DataVolumeTemplates
- Any PVC created in tenant cluster manifests targeting Azure
